Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: Python 3.14
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Maintainer: k1tty-xz
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: firmware (>= @MIN_IOS@), ca-certificates
Conflicts: python3, org.coolstar.python3, com.bingner.python3
Replaces: python3, org.coolstar.python3, com.bingner.python3
Description: Python @PY_MAJOR_MINOR@ for jailbroken iOS
 A native arm64 Python runtime for the iOS command line.
 .
 Includes the Python standard library, pip, OpenSSL @OPENSSL_VER@ LTS for TLS,
 libffi for ctypes, and subprocess support through posix_spawn.
 .
 Commands: python3, python@PY_MAJOR_MINOR@, pip, pip3, and pip@PY_MAJOR_MINOR@.
 Requires iOS @MIN_IOS@ or later.
